Adaptation by the Stopper project:
Selected compatible EasyList Cookie cosmetic filters are transformed from
Adblock Plus syntax into declarative Safari Content Blocker CSS rules.
Compatible domain exceptions are preserved; unsupported, procedural and
non-cosmetic rules are omitted. A published release manifest identifies
the exact source revision and SHA-256 checksums.

The adapted filter dataset is made available under CC BY-SA 3.0.
Recipients may share and adapt these data under the license conditions,
including attribution and ShareAlike, without additional restrictions.
This license applies to the adapted filter data, not to the privately
maintained Stopper application's source code.

No endorsement by the EasyList authors is implied.
